    ICAO -->|SARPs & PANS| EU
    EU -->|Basic Regulation| EASA
    EASA -->|Implementing Rules & AMC/GM| NAA
    NAA -->|Certificates & Oversight| AOC
    NAA -->|Aerodrome Certification| APT
    NAA -->|ANSP Designation| ANS
    AOC <-->|Turnaround & Stand Ops| APT
    AOC <-->|Flight Planning & Separation| ANS
